# SmartRocket course: size W H; target X Y RADIUS; barrier LEFT TOP WIDTH HEIGHT
# The original three-barrier course at 1024x768. Solved by the default settings
# in roughly 10 to 25 generations; see docs/adr/0005.
size 1024 768
target 512 50 25
barrier 0 512 896 25
barrier 256 256 768 25
barrier 0 96 256 25
